REGENT OF GARUT
WEST JAVA PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF GARUT REGENCY
NUMBER 13 OF 2016
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF GARUT,

Considering : a. that in order to guarantee and protect the rights of women and children so they can participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and honor, and receive protection from violence, it is necessary to undertake efforts to protect women and children optimally through increasing broad community participation;
b. that the prevalence of cases of violence against women and children in Garut Regency requires handling and concrete action from the Regional Government to formulate policies and programs to eliminate all forms of violence against women and children;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children from Violence;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas Within the Province of West Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1950 Number 8), as amended by Law Number 4 of 1968 concerning the Establishment of Purwakarta Regency and Subang Regency by Amending Law Number 14 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Regency Areas Within the Province of West Java (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1968 Number 31, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 2851);
